    "openingCompanyYardCMDWhichCerberusShallTheYardConvertCommander": "Which Cerberus shall the yard convert, Commander?",
    "openingCompanyYardCMDReturnToPort": "Return to port",
    "openingCompanyYardCMDNessaSaysSheLlKeepTheOld": "Nessa's hanging the old pressure seals on her office wall. Says I have a reputation to keep up. She stayed for the pressure test herself and left it off the bill. Don't mention it. She'll deny it.",
    "openingCompanyYardCMDTheYardHasFinishedEighteenMorePlaces": "The yard's done. Eighteen more berths, a proper command fit and a workshop gantry, for twenty-five units of hold we're going to miss. It's permanent work, Commander. No taking it back.",
    "openingCompanyYardCMDOurPrepaidPreparationStoresAreInThis": "Our prepaid stores are in this planet's depot, and they only reach the workshop while we're docked here. Open Marine operations and name the converted Cerberus our command ship. I'll walk you through the rest.",
    "openingCompanyYardCMDCastleCompanyOfficer": "CASTLE / COMPANY OFFICER",
    "openingCompanyYardCMDNessaVennMetUsAtTheBerth": "Nessa met us at the berth. Took one look at the patch under the collar and asked if I'd done it myself. I said I'd supervised. She remembers what that means. Here's her estimate, Commander. She held to it.",
    "openingCompanyYardCMDHerRacksAreHalfEmptyMostOf": "Her racks are half empty. Most of her parts come up the Wayline road, and raiders have had it shut for a month. Her sister Mara got handed the drivers' cooperative when its director left, and she's wearing herself thin keeping them from selling the trucks too. I said we'd be looking for work, and that we've no licence. Nessa said Mara can't afford anyone who has one. Then she said, \"Talk to her when you've got something that flies. Not before.\"",
    "openingCompanyYardCMDTheYardCanMakeRoomForBunks": "The yard will clear space for bunks and a workshop. I asked them to leave the compartments that still hold pressure alone. Look the estimate over, Commander. We only get to do this once.",
    "openingCompanyYardCMDMercenaryCompanyConversion": "Mercenary Company Conversion{0}",
    "openingCompanyYardCMDPermanentInstallationPersonnelCapacityCargoCapacityExpanded": "Permanent installation: +18 personnel capacity, -25 cargo capacity, expanded barracks, company command eligibility and one workshop gantry. The existing single boat berth remains; the hullmod includes no boat or mech.",
    "openingCompanyYardCMDYardCostCreditsCastleSReservedPayment": "Yard cost: {0} credits / Castle''s reserved payment: {1} / Pressure test waived: {2} / Due from fleet: {3} / Fleet funds: {4} / Short by: {5}",
    "openingCompanyYardCMDIVeKeptThisPaymentAsideSince": "I've kept this payment apart since we left the Claim. It doesn't touch the ship's account. Shuttle parts and the squad's kit are paid as well.",
    "openingCompanyYardCMDInstallConversionUseReservedPayment": "Install conversion - use reserved payment",
    "openingCompanyYardCMDInstallConversionCredits": "Install conversion - {0} credits",

