    "openingBarracksCommandSabineHaleFoundingFieldCommanderAFormer": "Sabine Hale / Founding field commander. Commanded the escort section on Harker's Claim's ore runs. When the operator stopped paying for escorts, twelve of her people stayed with her, and all thirteen came aboard Second Wind. She wants clear orders and a counted muster, and she does the counting herself. Her specialty, promotions and service record grow through your decisions.",
