    "openingShipConditionSteadyLightsAgainWeHaveReplacedThe": "Steady lights again. We have replaced the tired distribution runs. Sealed rooms still need their own repairs.",
    "openingShipConditionWeAreNursingOldCableAndScorched": "We are nursing old cable and scorched breakers. The working rooms are safe, but too many watches are being stood under emergency lamps.",
    "openingShipConditionRestoreSteadyLightsThroughoutTheWorkingCompartments": "Restore steady lights throughout the working compartments. Sealed rooms need separate structural repairs.",
    "openingShipConditionThereIsRoomForAFullLance": "There's room for a full lance, but the belt has been through the pressure skin and all four gantries are wrecked. Nobody goes through that hatch until a recovery crew makes it safe.",
    "openingShipConditionWaywardHasAHomeTheRecoveryCrew": "Wayward has a home. The recovery crew sealed the breach and restored berth one. The remaining gantries need their own rails, power and servicing equipment repaired. We can bring them back one at a time.",
    "openingShipConditionFourWorkingGantriesWeHaveEarnedBack": "Four working gantries. We have earned back a home for a full lance, with a clear service aisle between the machines.",
    "openingShipConditionMissionTakeBackTheDepotRestoresBerth": "MISSION 2: Take Back the Depot restores berth one with Wayward's recovery. No separate bill for the first berth.",
    "openingShipConditionWorkingMechBerths": "WORKING: {0} / 4 mech berths. {1}",
    "openingShipConditionNextRestoreBerthForOneAdditionalMech": "NEXT: Restore berth {0} for one additional mech. Acquire its chassis separately.",
    "openingShipConditionVisitMechLabToFabricateOrFit": "Visit Mech Lab to fabricate or fit the lance.",
    "openingShipConditionTheFirstBerthWasRestoredWithThe": "The first berth was restored with the depot recovery.",
    "openingShipConditionLockedUntilTheSecondStoryMissionIs": "Locked until the second story mission is complete.",
    "openingShipConditionHotMealsAndATableTogetherYou": "Hot meals and a table together. You can hear the difference already. They have somewhere to be a company again.",
    "openingShipConditionTheMessTookAHitWeAre": "A rock came through the mess years before we ever lit her. We're feeding everyone field rations in the working quarters, and they deserve better. The yard can seal the breach and put the galley and tables right.",
    "openingShipConditionCompanyInfantryRecoverMoraleFasterOnceIncoming": "{0}Company infantry recover morale 25% faster once incoming fire stops. Applies to future deployments from this active company home.",
