    "openingCompanyFoundingIntelDepotLost": "The port holding our prepaid stores is closed to us now. Castle has had them sent on; they will be held at the next working yard we dock at:",
    "openingCompanyFoundingIntelShuttlePartsAndFirstSquadStoresAre": "Shuttle parts and first-squad stores are separately earmarked. Other workshop jobs cannot draw these supplies.",
