		"equipmentTemplateAccessRestrictedRoute": "Approved military issue. No market, license, patron or recovery offers it without a military warrant from the tradition that builds it.",
		"equipmentTemplateAccessRestrictedRouteFmt": "{0} military issue. It is offered only through {0} license and patron channels, and only to a company holding a {0} military warrant. Reputation and victories alone never open it.",
