	"agreusArcPlaceBlackSluice": "BLACK SLUICE",
	"agreusArcAccessUnavailable": "Agreus / Arcadia access unavailable or its administration has changed; Rusk's contract is paused.",
	"agreusArcMissionWaterUnderSeal": "Water Under Seal",
	"agreusArcMissionLimitedWarrant": "Limited Warrant",
	"agreusArcMissionYardOwners": "The Yard's Owners",
	"agreusArcMissionSmallWar": "A Small War",
	"agreusArcMissionTermsOfProtection": "Terms of Protection",
	"agreusArcLossesWater": "Previous confirmed employer losses: {0} technicians, {1} constables and {2} repair loads. This mobilization supplies replacement personnel and cargo.",
	"agreusArcWarrantRecordsDone": "The service archive is already authenticated; this commission begins with the calibration recovery.",
	"agreusArcLossesWarrant": "Previous confirmed losses: {0} supplier technicians, {1} constables and {2} calibration loads. Replacement people and calibration stock are funded for this mobilization.",
	"agreusArcLossesYard": "Confirmed prior losses: {0} technicians, {1} constables and {2} calibration machines. This is a replacement inspection party and refit, not a pristine-yard report.",
	"agreusArcLossesSmallWar": "Confirmed prior losses: {0} custody-party members, {1} holders and {2} marked fuel installations. This mobilization brings a replacement custody party, holders and refitted controls; the losses stay on record.",
	"agreusArcLossesTerms": "Confirmed prior losses: {0} representatives, {1} technicians, {2} other employer people and {3} records carriers. Rusk funds a replacement party and carrier for this mobilization; the signed agreement stands.",
	"agreusArcRouteCustody": "Ratified House Custody: Rusk's appointed custodians take the handover, and the disclosed 12,000-credit premium is paid once with this victory.",
	"agreusArcRouteCompact": "Ratified Yard Compact: a joint custody party takes the handover; the premium was forgone to fund the transition guarantee.",
	"agreusArcReqWater": "Two squads recommended; two selected squads with at least four ready marines each required. Regular issue is sufficient. Your fitted boats carry your selected marines. You must bring an owned working construction tender. Eight constables and two technicians support a fresh repair load. North Weir / Ko Combine concession.",
	"agreusArcReqWarrant": "Two full regular squads recommended; two selected squads with at least four ready marines each required. Your fitted boats and owned working tender; four constables and one supplier technician. 30,000 credits and one Recovered Specter card on successful recovery, once. No yard agreement.",
	"agreusArcReqYard": "Three full squads recommended; minimum two selected squads with four ready marines each. Fitted boats and owned working tender required. Eight constables, two technicians; employer heavy lift for an owned active mech lance, optional. 36,000 credits and Recovered Arbalest card once on inspected handover. No custody agreement.",
	"agreusArcReqSmallWarCustody": "Three full squads recommended; minimum two selected squads with four ready marines each. Fitted boats required; no tender on this contract. Twelve estate guards and a three-person custody party; employer heavy lift for an owned active mech lance, optional. 44,000 credits once on completed handover, plus the 12,000-credit House Custody premium.",
	"agreusArcReqSmallWarCompact": "Three full squads recommended; minimum two selected squads with four ready marines each. Fitted boats required; no tender on this contract. Twelve constables and a three-person custody party; employer heavy lift for an owned active mech lance, optional. 44,000 credits once on completed handover. No suit card.",
	"agreusArcTermsBriefCommon": "Castle: Rusk pays 32,000 credits to see the signed handover done at Latchkey. Escort the party's carrier from the apron to the dispatch handover bay; it rolls only while our infantry is with it and nothing hostile has it in sight. The representatives sign at the bay once dispatch is held. Being nearby signs nothing. Then the utilities crew commissions the captured rig tooling in the calibration room: seventy-five seconds of work, paused, not restarted, while anyone hostile is inside the hall or our infantry is not. Ratification needs a living representative at dispatch after every committed attack is resolved. The end of an attack ratifies nothing. Losing both representatives, the records carrier, or both technicians before the work is done ends the attempt; other losses are recorded. Constables still hold the operator entrance we secured. Bring your working tender; Rusk funds heavy lift for an owned active mech lance. No bombardment or fighter strikes over the homes and benches.",
	"agreusArcTermsCustody": "House Custody: Rusk's two appointed custodians ride with the custodial records carrier, with his utilities crew and four estate guards. The guards will hold the Cinder Steps gate on Rusk's terms. That frees one of our sections; their post is the weak point if anyone comes down the lane.",
	"agreusArcTermsCompact": "Yard Compact: the joint party, Rusk's custodian and the association's delegate, rides with the joint-party records carrier, with the utilities crew and three of Lenna's fitters. The fitters will not leave the benches while the tooling is commissioned, so the hall itself has to be held, not only its doors.",
	"agreusArcTermsAward": "Either route: the technicians' Boarding Jack refurbishment dossier is a once-only section card, delivered to fleet cargo on victory. Learning and fitting it are explicit Armory choices; nobody is refitted automatically.",
	"agreusArcTermsUnknown": "Voss says she told Pell to leave it. We have no count of his people and no time. The yard's approaches are the south service road and the Cinder Steps lane.",
	"agreusArcReqTermsCustody": "Three squads recommended, mixed sections useful; minimum two selected squads with four ready marines each. Fitted boats and owned working tender required. Two custodians, two technicians, four estate guards and one records carrier; four constables at the operator entrance. Employer heavy lift for an owned active mech lance, optional. 32,000 credits once and a Boarding Jack section entitlement on either route; victory ratifies the signed agreement.",
	"agreusArcReqTermsCompact": "Three squads recommended, mixed sections useful; minimum two selected squads with four ready marines each. Fitted boats and owned working tender required. Two joint-party representatives, two technicians, three fitters and one records carrier; four constables at the operator entrance. Employer heavy lift for an owned active mech lance, optional. 32,000 credits once and a Boarding Jack section entitlement on either route; victory ratifies the signed agreement.",
